SPRITE ASSETS (IN)
==================

Source PNG images for Neo Geo sprite tiles (C ROMs).

  Format:   PNG (indexed palette preferred, or RGB/RGBA auto-converted)
  Colours:  15 per image + 1 transparency index (palette index 0 = transparent)
  Size:     multiples of 16x16 pixels recommended
  Naming:   0.png, 1.png, 2.png ... (romdbimgimport.py imports these)

img2neo.py performs k-means palette reduction (15 colours) and
Floyd-Steinberg dithering automatically if the image exceeds the colour limit.

Run: make art   (full sprite pipeline → 777-c1.c1 and 777-c2.c2)
